    "enUS": {
      "description": "This hearty stew keeps our trainees fed, enough so that our enemies remain at a distance.\r\n\r\nBring this and feed our trainees to the west. Don't listen to any complaints. With how difficult defending our supply lines has become, they should be so lucky we're not feeding them dirt.",
